# Describe the bug
When the UPF receives a PFCP Association Setup Request that is missing the Node ID, handleAssociationSetupRequest directly calls IE.NodeID() on the empty IE. This results in a nil pointer dereference and causes a crash, leading to a DoS.

# Release Information
Component: UPF (pfcpiface)
Version: upf-epc-pfcpiface:2.1.2-dev

# Logs
